And RCCB can also say that the current operated
而 RCCB 也可以说是电流动作型的

90
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:38,000
is the residual current circuit breaker
剩余电流动作断路器，

91
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:42,000
or the current operated is the residual current device.
或者说是电流动作型的剩余电流保护装置。

92
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:46,000
The earth connection in ELCB should be in good condition
ELCB 的接地连接必须状况良好，

93
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:49,000
