then it will function well.
它也能正常工作。

96
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,000
That is, it will work well.
也就是说，它照样能很好地工作。

97
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:00,000
In ELCB, the leakage current
在 ELCB 中，泄漏电流

98
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,000
or the filed current
或者故障电流

99
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,000
should flow from its earth pass.
应该从它的接地路径流走。

100
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:07,000
If it is not flowing from the earth pass
如果它不从接地路径流走，

101
