then it will not work, it will not operate.
那么它就不会工作，不会动作。

102
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,000
And in RCCB, the current leakage
而在 RCCB 中，漏电电流

103
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,000
flows from the earth pass
从接地路径流走时，

104
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:18,000
then it will trip, otherwise it will not operate.
它就会跳闸，否则就不会动作。

105
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:21,000
So, the first ELCB that used to come
所以，以前用的第一代 ELCB

106
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:25,000
