we call as current operated
我们称之为电流动作型

109
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:31,000
residual current circuit breaker.
剩余电流动作断路器。

110
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:34,000
So, the main difference in this is that
所以，这里面的主要区别在于，

111
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:37,000
you have to understand that the first ELCB that used to come
你要明白，以前用的第一代 ELCB

112
